{
  "format_version": 2,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "chapter": "residential",
  "conversations": {
    "residential_arrival": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "ra_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ra_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "三栋楼围着一个院子。有人把衣服晾在楼间，风没怎么动，衣服也没动。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ra_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "院子里有个滑梯、一张长椅，旁边还有一小块草地。草没长出来，倒是水泥地占了大半。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "residential_arrived",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.residential"
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "residential_arrived",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你走到了学校后面的居民楼：三栋楼围着一个院子。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ra_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "楼和楼之间有条路。你没走过那条路，但它像是从一道缝里接过来的。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "residential_stair": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "rs_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "rs_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "两栋楼之间有一段楼梯。数了数，十一级台阶，一个平台，上面还有一段。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "up",
              "text": "往上走。",
              "next": "rs_up_1"
            },
            {
              "id": "down",
              "text": "留在原地。",
              "next": "rs_down_1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rs_up_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你往上走。到了平台，回头看，下面那段楼梯像是刚才走过的那一段。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "residential_loop_stair",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你爬上楼与楼之间那段楼梯，又回到了原地。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rs_up_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你又往下走。台阶数没变。",
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "rs_down_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你没往上走。楼梯还在那儿，一直通向上面。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "animal_sighting": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "a_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "a_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "花坛边上有个绿色的东西。不是绿篱的颜色。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "animal_seen",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.animal"
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "animal_seen",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你在花坛边的水泥地上看见一只绿色的动物。你说不出那是什么。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "它是湿的，动得很慢，像在数什么。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "closer",
              "text": "走近两步。",
              "next": "a_c_1"
            },
            {
              "id": "stay",
              "text": "站着不动。",
              "next": "a_s_1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a_c_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "它没跑，只是转了转头，眼睛一直跟着你。"
        },
        {
          "id": "a_c_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "凑近了才看清：扁嘴，湿漉漉的毛，尾巴像一把桨，悬在地面上。",
          "next": "a_recall",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "animal_bill_seen",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "这只绿色的动物有扁扁的嘴和扁扁的尾巴。别的都说不清。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a_s_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你站着没动。它也没理你，继续忙自己的。"
        },
        {
          "id": "a_s_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "它一直看着你，没躲，也没别的动作。",
          "next": "a_recall"
        },
        {
          "id": "a_recall",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你在生物课本里见过类似的图。想翻到那一页，却想不起页码。",
          "source": "recalled",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "animal_recall",
              "source": "recalled",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "这只动物让你想起生物课本里的一张图。你翻不到那一页。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a_end",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你还是认不出它。也不知道它为什么会在这儿。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "animal_again": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "aa_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "aa_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "它还在那儿。已经沿着花坛挪出去一米左右，正朝着巷子那边。"
        },
        {
          "id": "aa_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你还是没认出它是什么。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
